  "overview": "Zenitsu is the highest-risk, highest-reward character in the roster. He has access to only one Skill Attack type (Thunderclap and Flash, Form 1) in four distinct variants, but it is the fastest gap-closer in the game at 12-frame total startup. His punish damage after a Guard Counter is the highest of any character. However, his one-dimensional Skill Attack set makes him extremely readable once opponents understand his options—intermediate and above players can consistently predict and counter his sole approach tool. Mastery of Zenitsu requires understanding precisely when and which variant of Thunderclap and Flash to use, not just spamming the fastest one.",
  "overviewJa": "善逸はロスター内で最高リスク・最高リターンのキャラクター。使える技攻撃は1種類（霹靂一閃・壱ノ型）で4バリアントだが、合計12フレームの始動でゲーム最速の間合い詰め技を持つ。ガードカウンター後のパニッシュダメージは全キャラ中最高。ただし、一次元的な技セットは相手が選択肢を理解すると極めて予測しやすくなる—中級以上のプレイヤーは唯一のアプローチツールを一貫して予測して対処できる。善逸の習得は最速バリアントをスパムすることではなく、どの霹靂一閃バリアントをいつ使うかの正確な判断が必要。",
